| `shop-web-1-data` | `AWS::EC2::Volume` | `storage.block` | direct | `Block Storage LUKS` |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Block Storage LUKS` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-2` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
